          {
            "question": "1. What is the cost of fox trapping services in Melbourne?",
            "answer_html": "<p><span >Fox trapping services in Melbourne typically cost between $200 to $600 depending on property size and infestation level. </span><b>7 States Pest Control</b><span > offers reliable and cost-effective fox control solutions.</span></p>"
          },
          {
            "question": "2. Is fox trapping legal in Melbourne?",
            "answer_html": "<p><span >Yes, fox trapping is legal in Melbourne when carried out by licensed professionals following local wildlife regulations. </span><b>7 States Pest Control</b><span > ensures all services comply with Australian laws.</span></p>"
          },
          {
            "question": "3. How do professionals trap and remove foxes?",
            "answer_html": "<p><span >Professionals use safe and humane trapping methods along with proper relocation or control techniques. </span><b>7 States Pest Control</b><span > uses effective and ethical fox control strategies.</span></p>"
          },
          {
            "question": "4. How quickly can fox removal be done in Melbourne?",
            "answer_html": "<p><span >Fox trapping and removal time depends on activity level, but </span><b>7 States Pest Control</b><span > offers prompt and efficient service to handle urgent situations.</span></p>"
          },
          {
            "question": "5. How can I prevent foxes from entering my property?",
            "answer_html": "<p><span >To prevent foxes, secure food sources, close entry points, and maintain clean surroundings. </span><b>7 States Pest Control</b><span > also provides expert advice and prevention solutions.</span></p>"
